    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zugaran</i> is a casual and simple psychological horror where you repeat the same nightly ritual in more than 15 short episodes, but each time, new horrors unfold. Uncover fragments of your past, dodge lurking monsters, and slowly piece together the truth behind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.poster.webp?t=1752413951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.webp?t=1752413951\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You rented an apartment in Dreamtown for a short business trip. But each night, you wake up to use the toilet... and reality cracks a little more. Something is wrong. The apartment isn\u2019t quite what it seems. The routine feels too familiar. The walls shift. The phone rings. And every night, the terror gets closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this your home, or your mind trying to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.poster.webp?t=1752413951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.webp?t=1752413951\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zugaran</i> is a casual and simple psychological horror where you repeat the same nightly ritual in more than 15 short episodes, but each time, new horrors unfold. Uncover fragments of your past, dodge lurking monsters, and slowly piece together the truth behind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.poster.webp?t=1752413951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.webp?t=1752413951\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You rented an apartment in Dreamtown for a short business trip. But each night, you wake up to use the toilet... and reality cracks a little more. Something is wrong. The apartment isn\u2019t quite what it seems. The routine feels too familiar. The walls shift. The phone rings. And every night, the terror gets closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this your home, or your mind trying to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.poster.webp?t=1752413951\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842370/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.webp?t=1752413951\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p>",
